    "pairedCaptureLimitations": "The Legacy dashboard keeps all campus tabs in one page while Next provides one route per section; paired images use the same campus, locale, theme, and viewport but do not establish pixel parity. Legacy JSON keeps historical :/assets/campuses map references while the current campus RCC uses :/resource-packs/campuses, so this capture target supplies a read-only qrc alias for the same Bundang map PNG bytes to make both map previews visible. The alias exists only in this capture target.",
